===Verb===
{{en-verb}}
# {{chiefly|North America|law}} To behave as a [[jaywalker]]; to violate pedestrian traffic regulations by crossing a street away from a designated [[crossing]] or to walk in the part of the street intended for cars rather than on the [[sidewalk]].<!--same thing: # To cross or walk in a [[street]] or [[roadway]] without regard to [[traffic]]-->

